{"id":"d479f6905149836f","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-top-separable-space.md","title":"ZFC Top Separable Space","display":"df-zfc-top-separable-space — ZFC Top Separable Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top-separable-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top-separable-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top-separable-space — ZFC Top Separable Space","depends_on":["[[./58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top-separable-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top-separable-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top-separable-space — ZFC Top Separable Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"./58-df-topology.md\">58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"./58-df-topology.md\">58-df-topology.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopSeparableSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopSeparableSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}separable\\text{-}space} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopSeparableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\n\\exists D\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D)\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(U\\neq\\emptyset\\to U\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}separable\\text{-}space} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopSeparableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\n\\exists D\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D)\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(U\\neq\\emptyset\\to U\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","locati